<xml xmlns="https://developers.google.com/blockly/xml"><block type="offer_generic" id="ai00013" x="50" y="50"><comment pinned="true" h="220" w="520">AI draft: Gold tier members get a one-time 100 bonus points (DELTA MILES) on each Spend transaction made on a Saturday or Sunday, when the amount is $50 or more and the store is Chennai HQ (HQ) or Elite Group Online (WEB). The bonus is given once per transaction, even if both conditions match.&#10;&#10;Assumptions:&#10;- "Spends" means the SPEND activity type (Spend). If you meant PURCHASE (Shopping), it can be switched or added.&#10;- Gold tier is checked using the member's Tier Class. The catalog has two Gold codes (GOLD and Gold), so both are included.&#10;- "Chennai HQ store" is location code HQ. The separate location code 'Chennai' is not included.&#10;- "Online store" is location WEB (Elite Group Online).&#10;- Weekend means Saturday (6) and Sunday (7), based on the transaction date.&#10;- "At least $50" means a BIT Amount of 50 or more. Currency is not checked.&#10;- No start or end date and no per-member usage limit were given, so the bonus applies to every qualifying transaction with no time limit.</comment><statement name="activities"><block type="activity" id="ai00012"><statement name="ACTIVITY_CRITERIA"><block type="activity_criteria" id="ai00001"><mutation xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml" object="activity" attribute="h_bit_type" operators="in" payoperators="null" iscountertypevector="no" value="SPEND" visible_value="Spend" type="LOOKUP"></mutation><field name="OBJECT">activity</field><field name="attribute">h_bit_type</field><field name="operators">in</field></block></statement><statement name="RULES"><block type="rule" id="ai00011"><field name="IDENTIFIER">Bonus</field><statement name="CONDITION"><block type="if_generic_adaptive" id="ai00004"><mutation xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml" object="member" attribute_level="MA_P" attribute="tier_class" operators="in" payoperators="null" visible_value="Gol